00:00:24.606 --> 00:00:26.296
Today we are eating three different steaks

00:00:26.296 --> 00:00:28.146
at three different price
points and we're gonna find out

00:00:28.146 --> 00:00:30.497
which one is the most
worth it at its price.

00:00:30.497 --> 00:00:31.863
- The most worth it because

00:00:31.863 --> 00:00:32.761
that's what we're
- Because it's the show name.

00:00:32.761 --> 00:00:33.629
- calling this show.

00:00:33.629 --> 00:00:34.462
- [Steve] It's called Worth It.

00:00:34.462 --> 00:00:35.295
- [Both] Worth it.

00:00:35.295 --> 00:00:36.331
