but it is the best way.

00:00:41.466 --> 00:00:42.966
- $10 for parking?

00:00:42.966 --> 00:00:44.858
Gees-a-loo, #NotWorthIt.

00:00:44.858 --> 00:00:47.670
- Which is funny because the
first steak is actually $11.

00:00:47.670 --> 00:00:49.579
- I hope this isn't a mistake.

00:00:49.579 --> 00:00:52.326
- Ho-oh, that was terrible.

00:00:52.326 --> 00:00:54.076
